Lab: Implementing Rollback in CI/CD Pipelines
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Understand the importance of rollback mechanisms in CI/CD pipelines
Implement automated rollback logic using previous container image tags
Configure a deployment pipeline that detects failed deployments and triggers a rollback
Execute and verify rollback procedures in a containerized environment
Apply blue-green deployment concepts to achieve zero-downtime rollback
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of containerization concepts (Docker)
Familiarity with CI/CD pipeline concepts
Experience with command-line interface operations (bash)
Basic knowledge of Python and Flask
A Linux machine or VM with Docker installed and running
Install the required tools before starting (skip any that are already installed):

